      "semantics": [
        "对应参考 self.conv_transpose(x)，使用 cuDNN 实现 ConvTranspose1d。",
        "输入 shape [N, C_in, L_in]，权重 shape [C_in, C_out/groups, K]。",
        "输出长度 L_out = (L_in - 1)*stride - 2*padding + kernel_size + output_padding。",
        "无 bias，仅执行卷积转置运算。",
        "输出张量按 PyTorch ConvTranspose1d 格式，连续或按 strides 正确处理。"
      ]
