        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "same as input"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考 torch.add(x, self.bias)，将 bias 广播到输入张量的每个空间位置。",
        "bias shape [out_channels, 1] 广播到 [batch, out_channels, length]，沿通道维度相加。",
        "输入输出 dtype/device 一致。"
      ]
    },
